# RAHSA CAFE — Art Credits

All in-game pixel art is genuine hand-made work by independent artists, used under
permissive licenses. No AI-generated sprite art is used in the game.

## Primary set — Anokolisa (AnomalyPixel)
**"Pixel Crawler — Free Pack"** (top-down 16x16 medieval-fantasy RPG)
Source: https://anokolisa.itch.io/free-pixel-art-asset-pack-topdown-tileset-rpg-16x16-sprites
Covers: interior walls/floors, tavern furniture (tables, chairs, stoves, counters,
bar, plants, shelves, doors, rugs), guest NPCs (Peasant, Tavern wench, Knight,
Rogue, Wizard — with walk animations), player base body (with walk animations).

License (author's Terms.txt): free for commercial/study/any project; may be freely
altered in any shape, color or pattern; credit optional but appreciated; may not be
resold as a standalone asset. Contact: AnomalyPixel@gmail.com
Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/Anokolisa — Twitter: https://twitter.com/Anokolisa

Player customization layers (skin/shirt/pants tints, 4 hairstyles) and guest palette
variants were composed from this pack's sprites at build time (see build_assets.py).

